P6, absolutely—solidify. My preliminary threat ranking:
1) P7: too aggressive, pragmatic, will exploit alliances;
2) P2: observant, data-driven, could flip if a better offer comes;
3) P5: vague, keeps options open, might betray.

I suggest we focus our votes on P7 now. If we coordinate, we’ll eliminate a high-risk player. Does that match your data? Over to you.
